SSM-JA LICENSE v1.0

1. Scope

This license applies to the SSM-JA materials distributed within the SSM-JA/
directory unless a specific file or directory states otherwise.

The covered materials are divided into:

- reference implementation and verification artifacts; and
- documentation and architecture materials.

SSM-JTK materials outside the SSM-JA licensing boundary remain subject to the
separate licensing terms declared for SSM-JTK.

2. Reference Implementation and Verification Artifacts

The SSM-JA reference implementation and verification artifacts include, where
present, the standalone browser-native observatory, embedded runtime structures,
integrity-verification logic, test and verification artifacts, manifests,
machine-readable configuration, and other implementation or verification files
distributed as part of SSM-JA.

Permission is granted, without a license fee, to use, copy, modify, test, study,
and redistribute these materials for lawful purposes, including commercial and
non-commercial use, subject to the terms of this license.

A substantial redistribution of these materials must retain this license and any
applicable copyright or attribution notices included with the original materials.

Modified implementation or verification files must be clearly identified as
modified and must not imply that the modifications were verified, certified,
endorsed, approved, canonical, or authored by the original project maintainers.

Third-party components and separately identified materials remain subject to their
own licenses and notices.

